From 8b3fa3b06926de38691b6fa4180618c01e5ed400 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex6357 <73743056+Alex6357@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 20:55:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] optional: integrate iX ixnvdimm NVDIMM-N driver + tool onto
 15.1

Integration of TrueNAS ixnvdimm patches (25 commits) rebased onto
FreeBSD 15.1 as one group:
- ca02fa94619 initial import from freenas/11-stable (driver core)
- 5f7b58dc6cd NFIT control region + pnpinfo/location
- b5d295755ce NFIT flags sysctl
- db82359df42 ProximityDomain -> VM domain mapping
- 3879f6a5eb3 NUMA-aware IOAT channel selection
- b866725a3bd,7bb9340e07d,1590bc59d7f,67036bc9d6d,c4d0f444d38 IOAT DMA
- d809dbcbb36,0a5c0b7bbdb,c4478a23b29 DMAR cooperation (added+reverted+panic fix)
- dd54c1c2495 HA sync in taskqueue thread
- 4f0b010add9,02cfcc3a339 _NCH/_NBS, ARM_INFO health
- 049f1b7abc7,b6448ef5dcf4 string buffer, build polishing
- f1edb6447ff,facf1247039 13/14 version adaptation
- cdc92e3bc99,7797934da62,51b32003851,696d46c4b3f,0a7dd68a902 ixnvdimm tool + DSM

OPTIONAL because: this is iX-proprietary dual-controller NVDIMM
hardware support; ordinary NAS without that hardware does not need it.
15.1 has upstream sys/dev/nvdimm/ (basic NFIT+pmem) but lacks NTB
HA mirror / DSM firmware mgmt / IOAT NUMA; ixnvdimm is a superset kept
as an independent newbus tree.

Rebase notes vs 15.1: all driver/tool .c/.h/.S/.S are new files taken
from os HEAD (2117+55+130 + 1161 lines), with version-compat #if guards
(facf1247039 handles 13 vs 14 sbuf APIs). Registration files
(files.amd64, modules/Makefile, BSD.include.dist, include/Makefile,
usr.sbin/Makefile) merged with minimal conflicts (only files.amd64 +
include/Makefile needed manual resolve for upstream additions like
ncthwm). 15.1 rfb/vmmapi unaffected.
